flowchart TB
    U[Requester / analyst / reviewer / auditor] --> WEB[Arabic-English React console]
    WEB --> API[FastAPI: verified identity and tenant/resource policy]
    ID[OIDC provider] --> API
    API --> CASE[Procurement cases and deterministic policies]
    API --> DOC[Document intelligence and ACL-filtered RAG]
    API --> EXT[HR knowledge and service desk]
    CASE --> GRAPH[Bounded LangGraph runtime]
    GRAPH --> APPROVAL[Version-bound human approval]
    APPROVAL --> SIM[Simulated outcome and audit]
    GRAPH --> TOOLS[Typed allowlisted tools]
    GRAPH --> GATE[Governed model gateway]
    DOC --> GATE
    GATE --> MODEL[Permitted hosted OR private inference]
    DOC --> JOB[Ingestion queue and worker]
    JOB --> STORE[(Private versioned object storage)]
    JOB --> DB[(PostgreSQL and pgvector)]
    CASE --> DB
    DOC --> DB
    GRAPH --> DB
    APPROVAL --> DB
    EXT --> DB
    EXT --> ML[Advisory forecasting and model lifecycle]
    API -.-> OPS[Redacted telemetry / evaluations / operations]
    GRAPH -.-> OPS
    CI[CI, security gates and immutable artifacts] --> STAGE[Staging / UAT / authorised release]
    STAGE -.-> API
    DB -.-> DR[Approved backups / tested restore and rollback]
    STORE -.-> DR
